cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AgentCreditBench in your research, please cite this software."
title: "AgentCreditBench: A Conformance-Test Suite for Turn-Level Credit Estimators"
type: software
abstract: >-
  AgentCreditBench is a CPU-first conformance-test suite for turn-level credit
  assignment in agentic reinforcement learning. It compares GRPO, RLOO, GAE,
  GiGPO, Monte Carlo, and custom estimator outputs with exact policy advantages
  on tiny finite-horizon Markov decision processes, and separately evaluates
  the induced policy-gradient signal.
authors:
